<catalogue id="09b9-a81e-36e7-0078" name="EpicAU - Legio Titanicus" revision="17" battleScribeVersion="2.03" authorName="EpicAU Horus Heresy (community) - BSData conversion" authorContact="" authorUrl="https://web.archive.org/web/20201111221247/http://epicau.com/mw/index.php/Main_Page" library="false" gameSystemId="5924-e3fb-5543-3044" gameSystemRevision="14" xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema">
  <forceEntries>
    <forceEntry id="5a43-d432-849f-519a" name="Legio Titanicus" hidden="false">
      <rules>
        <rule id="f5b9-5387-4c14-3d3d" name="Army List" hidden="false">
          <description>Strategy Rating 3. Formation initiative 1+.
Each upgrade may only be taken once per formation.
Legio Titanicus has no Support Detachments.
Warhounds carry 2 Scout Titan weapons; Reavers 3 and Warlords 4 Scout or Battle Titan weapons. The fan-made Warbringer carries a Quake or Volcano Cannon plus 2 weapons, the Warmaster 1, the Dire Wolf 1 heavy weapon and the Iconoclast a Kirus siege drill or grav imploder. Weapons for one mount only (arm or carapace) are offered only in those slots.
The wiki sets no Allies/Lords of War points limit for Legio Titanicus.
Cohesive allies: Legion Astartes, Knight Household, Mechanicum Taghmata.
Disruptive allies: Imperial Militia, Solar Auxilia, Daemons Of The Ruinstorm.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink id="7df5-be88-43d5-1033" name="Allies" hidden="false" targetId="d6db-799f-23f8-2194" type="rule"/>
