      <rules>
        <rule id="21ef-6f43-0802-ab5a" name="Warbringer Nemesis Titan" hidden="false">
          <description>Fan rules, not part of EpicAU: adapted from the Epic-UK Adeptus Titanicus codex (version 080925), where it costs 750 pts with weapons. Here it takes a Quake or Volcano Cannon on the carapace and 2 arm weapons at EpicAU weapon costs. It has built-in AA guns, so no Air Defence upgrade. Priced, as in Epic-UK, a little above a Reaver with Air Defence carrying the same weapons.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink id="1f54-dc87-fd93-b5db" name="Line Detachment" hidden="false" targetId="71ca-c9e1-da76-27e2" primary="true"/>
