      <rules>
        <rule id="425d-9ebf-4eb3-0116" name="Dire Wolf Titan" hidden="false">
          <description>Fan-made, not part of EpicAU: a heavy scout Titan from Legions Imperialis on the Warhound chassis, with Infiltrator, built-in Ardex mega-bolters and one heavy weapon. It costs about 1/6 more than a Warhound with weapons, as in Legions Imperialis.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
