      <rules>
        <rule id="1c6e-d3c8-6248-1de3" name="Warmaster Iconoclast Titan" hidden="false">
          <description>Fan-made, not part of EpicAU: the close-assault Warmaster from Legions Imperialis, faster than the Warmaster, with a chainsword, a gatling array and a Kirus siege drill or grav imploder. Legions Imperialis prices it the same as the Warmaster; here it matches the Warmaster with a weapon. Like the Warmaster and the Emperor-class Titans it is a Lord of War with no limit.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
