  <sharedRules>
    <rule id="f64e-9b96-021b-6c0f" name="Carapace Landing Pad notes" hidden="false">
      <description>Carapace mount only. Grants BP weapons the Indirect Fire special rule.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="819a-f805-372f-99b1" name="Close Combat Weapon notes" hidden="false">
      <description>Arm mount only.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="8835-5fbf-601f-eef0" name="Conversion Beam Dissipator* notes" hidden="false">
      <description>Within 15cm it fires 2 x AP4+/AT4+ instead.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="3e53-777c-4a9a-a882" name="Corvus Assault Pod notes" hidden="false">
      <description>Transport. May carry 10 infantry units. Terminators, Breachers, Thallax, Ursarax, Myrmidon take up 2 spaces each.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="3315-dd85-51a2-af07" name="Dire Wolf Heavy Scout Titan* notes" hidden="false">
      <description>May step over impassable terrain or dangerous terrain that is lower than the titan's knees and no greater than 2cm wide. Critical Hit: The Titan staggers D6cm in a random direction taking an additional DC, any units that come into base contact with it as it staggers take a standard hit on a 6+.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="be19-a9d4-92b0-2ec0" name="Imperator Support Titan (experimental) notes" hidden="false">
      <description>Secondary Targeting Protocols. May step over impassable terrain or dangerous terrain that is lower than the titan's knees and no greater than 2cm wide. Critical Hit: Roll a D6 in the end phase for the remainder of the game, on a 1, the Titan's reactor explodes, destroying it completely and hitting all units within 5cm on a standard 4+ to hit, on a 2-3, the Titan loses a point of DC, 4-6 the reactor is repaired.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="11ac-9ec1-5560-5482" name="Kirus Grav Imploder* notes" hidden="false">
      <description>Disrupt, Ignore Cover AND (assault weapons) EA(+1), TK(D3).</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="f0ce-d9cd-7a36-deae" name="Reaver Battle Titan notes" hidden="false">
      <description>May step over impassable terrain or dangerous terrain that is lower than the titan's knees and no greater than 2cm wide. Critical Hit: Roll a D6 in the end phase for the remainder of the game, on a 1, the Titan's reactor explodes, destroying it completely and hitting all units within 5cm on a standard 6+ to hit, on a 2-3, the Titan loses a point of DC, 4-6 the reactor is repaired.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="ae14-09db-d6ed-d5af" name="Support Missile notes" hidden="false">
      <description>Warhead, One-shot; Vortex: 3 BP, MW, TK(1), Ignore Cover; Warp: MW2+, TK(D3); Deathstrike: MW2+, TK(D6); Barrage: 10 BP, DIsrupt. carapace only; Warp missiles ignore enemy shields.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="757c-9d08-dbc9-05bd" name="Warbringer Nemesis Titan* notes" hidden="false">
      <description>May step over impassable terrain or dangerous terrain that is lower than the titan's knees and no greater than 2cm wide. Critical Hit: Roll a D6 in the end phase for the remainder of the game, on a 1, the Titan's reactor explodes, destroying it completely and hitting all units within 5cm on a standard 4+ to hit, on a 2-3, the Titan loses a point of DC, 4-6 the reactor is repaired.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="1842-dbe4-8218-0dd4" name="Warhound Scout Titan notes" hidden="false">
      <description>May step over impassable terrain or dangerous terrain that is lower than the titan's knees and no greater than 2cm wide. Critical Hit: The Warhound staggers D6cm in a random direction taking an additional DC, any units that come into base contact with the Warhound as it staggers take a standard hit on a 6+.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="defa-6ea4-49ff-00ad" name="Warlord Battle Titan notes" hidden="false">
      <description>May step over impassable terrain or dangerous terrain that is lower than the titan's knees and no greater than 2cm wide. Critical Hit: Roll a D6 in the end phase for the remainder of the game, on a 1, the Titan's reactor explodes, destroying it completely and hitting all units within 5cm on a standard 4+ to hit, on a 2-3, the Titan loses a point of DC, 4-6 the reactor is repaired.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="8a36-763a-442c-98c3" name="Warlord-Sinister Battle Titan* notes" hidden="false">
      <description>Dread Aura: enemy formations within 15cm subtract 1 from their rally tests. A Psi-Titan for Loyalist Legions only. May step over impassable terrain or dangerous terrain that is lower than the titan's knees and no greater than 2cm wide. Critical Hit: Roll a D6 in the end phase for the remainder of the game, on a 1, the Titan's reactor explodes, destroying it completely and hitting all units within 5cm on a standard 4+ to hit, on a 2-3, the Titan loses a point of DC, 4-6 the reactor is repaired.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="46ae-f196-769b-4b59" name="Warmaster Heavy Battle Titan* notes" hidden="false">
      <description>May step over impassable terrain or dangerous terrain that is lower than the titan's knees and no greater than 2cm wide. Critical Hit: Roll a D6 in the end phase for the remainder of the game, on a 1, the Titan's reactor explodes, destroying it completely and hitting all units within 5cm on a standard 4+ to hit, on a 2-3, the Titan loses a point of DC, 4-6 the reactor is repaired.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="e3f7-e8e6-3aac-b465" name="Warmaster Iconoclast Titan* notes" hidden="false">
      <description>May step over impassable terrain or dangerous terrain that is lower than the titan's knees and no greater than 2cm wide. Critical Hit: Roll a D6 in the end phase for the remainder of the game, on a 1, the Titan's reactor explodes, destroying it completely and hitting all units within 5cm on a standard 4+ to hit, on a 2-3, the Titan loses a point of DC, 4-6 the reactor is repaired.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="e1de-76ea-5504-a404" name="Warmonger Support Titan (experimental) notes" hidden="false">
      <description>Secondary Targeting Protocols. May step over impassable terrain or dangerous terrain that is lower than the titan's knees and no greater than 2cm wide. Critical Hit: Roll a D6 in the end phase for the remainder of the game, on a 1, the Titan's reactor explodes, destroying it completely and hitting all units within 5cm on a standard 4+ to hit, on a 2-3, the Titan loses a point of DC, 4-6 the reactor is repaired.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
